  "bio": "Welcome to \"Mammut Tattoo,\" Planegg's premier destination for stunning black and gray ink masterpieces. Our studio celebrates the timeless art of tattooing, offering designs across every style to ensure your ink is not just for a moment, but forever. Experience the perfect fusion of creativity and German precision in a unique environment where every tattoo tells a story.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Planegg, Bavaria, Germany\n\nTattoos jeder Stilerichtung, Tattoos für immer.",
